    "title": "Hanger Foundation Gala Raises $900,000 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By The O&P EDGE ,\n1 days ago The Hanger Foundation’s third annual Night to Inspire gala fundraiser took place September 19 at the Country Music Hall of Fame in Nashville, Tennessee, raising $903,075. “Our vision of empowering people with physical challenges to live life to the fullest would not be possible without the extraordinary generosity of our donors and supporters, both here in Nashville and across the country,” said Scott Rowe, board president, Hanger Foundation; and vice president of tax, Hanger. “Events like this remind us that every contribution, regardless of size, helps create meaningful opportunities and lasting impact for those we serve.” Read full article",
